{"id":"wb-7-1028","name":"雪溪胡氏大院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"雪溪胡氏大院","text":"雪溪胡氏大院位于浙江省温州市泰顺县雪溪乡，建于道光至同治间。\n\n建筑面东北向，四面环砌麻石高墙，沿中轴线分布二进台门、南北屋及上、下堂，总占地面积4200平方米。\n\n第一进台门为石门楼，即整座大院的大门。石门楼左后方为第二进台门，又称前堂，面阔五间，进深三间。月梁、牛腿、斗拱等做工精细，表现题材多为龙凤、花鸟、人物故事等。后堂面阔七间，左右厢房面阔四间。明间为厅堂，用于家人集会待客与祭祀先祖。宅院大门前两侧，各有宗祠一。\n\n胡氏大院依山傍水，现保存完整。2005年3月16日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%AA%E6%BA%AA%E8%83%A1%E6%B0%8F%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%A2","revisionId":86783378,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783378","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f1d32b74775482ac0f855c06.jpg","title":"Xuexi_Hu's_Courtyard,_2021-05-03_08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xuexi_Hu%27s_Courtyard,_2021-05-03_08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Xuexi_Hu%27s_Courtyard%2C_2021-05-03_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​雪溪胡氏大院","width":320,"height":214},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}